@Server_HostAddress = https://localhost:7053

### Browse the catalogue (no login needed)
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/book
Accept: application/json

### Search books by title, ISBN or author name
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/book/search?text=achebe
Accept: application/json

### Register (the first account created becomes the administrator)
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Store Admin",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!",
  "confirmPassword": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Log in and copy the token into the Authorization header below
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Add a category (administrators only)
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/category
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <paste token here>

{
  "name": "Poetry"
}
